# Telegram Bot Notification Configuration
# ──────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Talk to @BotFather on Telegram and create a bot to get your Bot Token.
# 2. Send any message to your bot, then visit:
#    https://api.telegram.org/bot<YOUR_TOKEN>/getUpdates
#    to find your Chat ID.
# 3. Copy this file to 'telegram.conf' in the same directory as the scripts,
#    or place it at '/etc/pve-telegram.conf'.
# 4. Set secure permissions: chmod 600 telegram.conf

TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=""
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=""
